  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6301.01 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to all breath alcohol procedures using the intoxilyzer 5000 instrument for breath tests conducted before January 1, 2017.\n\nSource. #12064, INTERIM, eff 1-1-17, EXPIRES: 6-30-17; ss by #12216, eff 6-30-17",
